        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782140751013,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two dimentional array is a collection of multiple 1D array.\n\nIf we want to store multipe values we use 1D array.\n\nif we want store multipe groups of array we use 2D array\n\nTypes of 2D array\n==================\n\n1. rectangular 2D array.\n2. jagged 2D array.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two dimentional array is a collection of multiple 1D array.\n\nIf we want to store multipe values we use 1D array.\n\nif we want store multipe groups of array we use 2D array\n\nTypes of 2D array\n==================\n\n1. rectangular 2D array.\n2. jagged 2D array.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
